    "native application origin, isolated data and restricted renderer",
    "sandboxed native browser keeps one session identity across panel switches",
    "native window in light and dark palettes",
    "native host reads selected file into conversation",
    "clipboard through restricted native IPC",
    "native export writes selected destination and rejects invalid names",
    "native workspace listing, scoped reading and denied unknown handles",
    "native application menu dispatches into the session UI",
    "all four platform plugins installed and independently toggled",
    "platform pause intent does not fabricate remote stop",
    "knowledge revision attaches to the selected Circle session",
    "method loading leaves publication state unchanged",
    "application restart preserves the conversation and pinned input"
